---
// The state model as cells. Rows are the three jobs a state file does
// (identity, values, writes) and a fourth for the estate. The stock column
// is one tall cell, one file under one lock; choudoufu and plunge each give
// every job its own cell; the estate row joins the two into one cell, an
// estate named by a label on the resources. Pure HTML and CSS, so it reads
// without script and in both themes.
const C = 'https://intentius.io/choudoufu';
const P = 'https://intentius.io/plunge';
---
<figure class="sc not-content" aria-labelledby="sc-cap">
	<div class="sc-grid">
		<div class="sc-corner"></div>
		<div class="sc-colhead sc-stock-h"><span class="sc-k">One state file</span><span><code>terraform.tfstate</code> or a Pulumi checkpoint, one lock</span></div>
		<a class="sc-colhead sc-cdf-h" href={`${C}/`}><img src="/brand/vendors/choudoufu.svg" alt="" /><span class="sc-k">choudoufu</span><span>for OpenTofu</span></a>
		<a class="sc-colhead sc-pl-h" href={`${P}/`}><img src="/brand/vendors/plunge.png" alt="" class="sc-pixel" /><span class="sc-k">plunge</span><span>for Pulumi</span></a>

		<div class="sc-row sc-r1"><span class="sc-dot"></span><b>Identity</b><span>address to live object</span></div>
		<div class="sc-row sc-r2"><span class="sc-dot"></span><b>Values</b><span>passwords, random names</span></div>
		<div class="sc-row sc-r3"><span class="sc-dot"></span><b>Writes</b><span>runs side by side</span></div>

		<div class="sc-stock">
			<div class="sc-band sc-b1"><b>Identity</b><span>in the file</span></div>
			<div class="sc-band sc-b2"><b>Values</b><span>in the file</span></div>
			<div class="sc-band sc-b3"><b>Writes</b><span>one lock on the file</span></div>
			<div class="sc-lock" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10" rx="2" fill="currentColor" /><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" /></svg></div>
		</div>

		<a class="sc-cell sc-cdf sc-c1" href={`${C}/how-it-works/identity/`}>
			<span class="sc-tag"><i></i>tofu-estate <em>=</em> prod-networking</span>
			<span class="sc-tag"><i></i>tofu-address <em>=</em> aws_vpc.main</span>
			<p>A marker on the resource, written at create.</p>
		</a>
		<a class="sc-cell sc-pl sc-c1" href={`${P}/how-it-works/identity/`}>
			<span class="sc-tag"><i></i>plunge-stack <em>=</em> payments/prod</span>
			<span class="sc-tag"><i></i>plunge-urn <em>=</em> …Bucket::receipts</span>
			<p>Keyed by stack and URN, as a digest on labels.</p>
		</a>

		<a class="sc-cell sc-cdf sc-c2" href={`${C}/how-it-works/values/`}>
			<div class="sc-recs" aria-hidden="true"><span>db</span><span>dns</span><span>key</span></div>
			<p>A record per resource for generated values.</p>
		</a>
		<a class="sc-cell sc-pl sc-c2" href={`${P}/how-it-works/records/`}>
			<div class="sc-recs" aria-hidden="true"><span>db</span><span>dns</span><span>key</span></div>
			<p>A record per resource with its full state, secrets encrypted.</p>
		</a>

		<a class="sc-cell sc-cdf sc-c3" href={`${C}/how-it-works/locking/`}>
			<div class="sc-runs" aria-hidden="true"><span>A <small>db</small> <b>✓</b></span><span>B <small>dns</small> <b>✓</b></span></div>
			<p>A conditional write per record. Applies on different resources land together.</p>
		</a>
		<a class="sc-cell sc-pl sc-c3" href={`${P}/how-it-works/concurrency/`}>
			<div class="sc-runs" aria-hidden="true"><span>A <small>db</small> <b>✓</b></span><span>B <small>dns</small> <b>✓</b></span></div>
			<p>A conditional write per record. Updates on different resources land together.</p>
		</a>

		<div class="sc-row sc-r4"><span class="sc-dot"></span><b>Estate</b><span>resources that belong together</span></div>
		<div class="sc-stock-estate"><p>The resource list inside the state file.</p></div>
		<div class="sc-estate">
			<div class="sc-account" aria-hidden="true">
				<span class="sc-acct-name">one AWS account</span>
				<div class="sc-group sc-g-cdf"><span class="sc-g-label">tofu-estate = prod-networking</span><span>vpc</span><span>subnet</span><span>route table</span></div>
				<div class="sc-group sc-g-pl"><span class="sc-g-label">plunge-stack = payments/prod</span><span>bucket</span><span>queue</span><span>function</span></div>
			</div>
			<ul class="sc-facts">
				<li><b>List it</b> with any tool that filters by tag or label.</li>
				<li><b>Fence it</b> with an IAM condition on the label.</li>
				<li><b>Run both</b> in one <a href="https://intentius.io/chant/">chant</a> workspace, an OpenTofu root beside a Pulumi stack.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
	<figcaption id="sc-cap">A stock state file holds identity, values and writes in one file under one lock. choudoufu and plunge give each its own place: identity on the resource, values in a record per resource, and a conditional write per record. An estate is whatever carries its label.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.sc {
		--id: #3fae8c;
		--val: #e2a23b;
		--wr: #d9637a;
		--cdf: #c9a96e;
		--pl: #4a9fd0;
		--card: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-gray-6) 70%, transparent);
		--line: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
	}
	.sc-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 9.5rem minmax(11rem, 0.85fr) 1fr 1fr;
		grid-template-rows: auto repeat(3, auto) auto;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}
	.sc a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

	/* heads */
	.sc-colhead { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.1rem; padding: 0 0.2rem 0.4rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
	.sc-colhead img { height: 2rem; width: auto; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
	.sc-pixel { image-rendering: pixelated; border-radius: 4px; }
	.sc-k { font-family: var(--in-display, inherit); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-stock-h { justify-content: flex-end; padding-right: 1.2rem; }
	.sc-cdf-h .sc-k { color: var(--cdf); }
	.sc-pl-h .sc-k { color: var(--pl); }

	/* row labels */
	.sc-row { grid-column: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 0.15rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); line-height: 1.3; }
	.sc-row b { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-dot { width: 0.7rem; height: 0.7rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 22%, transparent); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
	.sc-r1 { grid-row: 2; --c: var(--id); }
	.sc-r2 { grid-row: 3; --c: var(--val); }
	.sc-r3 { grid-row: 4; --c: var(--wr); }
	.sc-r4 { grid-row: 5; --c: var(--sl-color-accent); }

	/* the stock column: one tall cell */
	.sc-stock { position: relative; grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2 / span 3; display: grid; grid-template-rows: subgrid; padding: 0.55rem; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--sl-color-black); border: 2px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); }
	.sc-stock-estate p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.45; }
	.sc-colhead code { font-size: 0.78rem; background: none; padding: 0; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
	.sc-band { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 0.15rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); border-left: 4px solid var(--c); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 16%, transparent); }
	.sc-band b { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-b1 { --c: var(--id); }
	.sc-b2 { --c: var(--val); }
	.sc-b3 { --c: var(--wr); }
	.sc-lock { position: absolute; top: 50%; right: -1.3rem; margin-top: -1.2rem; z-index: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 2.4rem; height: 2.4rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sl-color-gray-5); color: var(--sl-color-black); border: 3px solid var(--sl-color-black); }

	/* split cells */
	.sc-cell { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 3px solid var(--c); transition: transform .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease; }
	.sc-cell:hover, .sc-cell:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--p); border-top-color: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px -10px var(--p); }
	.sc-cell p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
	.sc-cdf { grid-column: 3; --p: var(--cdf); }
	.sc-pl { grid-column: 4; --p: var(--pl); }
	.sc-c1 { grid-row: 2; --c: var(--id); }
	.sc-c2 { grid-row: 3; --c: var(--val); }
	.sc-c3 { grid-row: 4; --c: var(--wr); }

	.sc-tag { align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; max-width: 100%; padding: 0.22rem 0.6rem 0.22rem 0.45rem; border-radius: 4px 999px 999px 4px; font: 0.74rem/1.3 var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p) 18%, transparent); color: var(--sl-color-white); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.sc-tag i { flex: none; width: 0.42rem; height: 0.42rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sl-color-black); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--p); }
	.sc-tag em { font-style: normal; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }

	.sc-recs { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; }
	.sc-recs span { position: relative; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; font: 600 0.72rem/1.2 var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--val) 15%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--val) 45%, transparent); color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-recs span::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0.3rem; top: 50%; width: 0.22rem; height: 0.22rem; margin-top: -0.11rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--val); }

	.sc-runs { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
	.sc-runs span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; padding: 0.28rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wr) 14%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--wr) 40%, transparent); color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-runs small { font: 0.72rem var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-weight: 400; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
	.sc-runs b { color: var(--id); }

	/* estate row */
	.sc-stock-estate { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 5; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0.9rem; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px dashed var(--line); }
	.sc-estate { grid-column: 3 / span 2; grid-row: 5; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; gap: 1.1rem; align-items: center; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background:
		linear-gradient(var(--sl-color-black), var(--sl-color-black)) padding-box,
		linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cdf), var(--pl)) border-box; border: 2px solid transparent; }
	.sc-account { position: relative; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; padding: 2.2rem 0.7rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 12px; row-gap: 1.1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); }
	.sc-acct-name { position: absolute; top: 0.4rem; left: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
	.sc-group { flex: 1 1 11rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; padding: 1.55rem 0.55rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px dashed var(--g); position: relative; }
	.sc-group > span:not(.sc-g-label) { padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.74rem; background: var(--sl-color-black); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--sl-color-gray-1); }
	.sc-group > span:not(.sc-g-label)::after { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 0.38rem; height: 0.38rem; margin-left: 0.35rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--g); vertical-align: middle; }
	.sc-g-label { position: absolute; top: -0.7rem; left: 0.5rem; padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px; font: 600 0.68rem/1.3 var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); background: var(--g); color: #14110b; white-space: nowrap; }
	.sc-g-cdf { --g: var(--cdf); }
	.sc-g-pl { --g: var(--pl); }
	.sc-facts { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.55rem; }
	.sc-facts li { margin: 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
	.sc-facts b { color: var(--sl-color-white); }
	.sc-facts a { color: var(--sl-color-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }

	.sc figcaption { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); max-width: 52rem; }

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .sc-cell { transition: none; } .sc-cell:hover { transform: none; } }

	/* narrow: the stock file on top, then each job with its two cells */
	@media (max-width: 60rem) {
		.sc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; }
		.sc-corner, .sc-stock-estate { display: none; }
		.sc-stock-h { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1; padding-right: 0; }
		.sc-stock { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 2; grid-template-rows: none; gap: 0.4rem; margin-right: 0.6rem; }
		.sc-lock { top: -0.9rem; right: -0.9rem; margin: 0; }
		.sc-cdf-h { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3; margin-top: 1rem; }
		.sc-pl-h { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 3; margin-top: 1rem; }
		.sc-row { grid-column: 1 / -1; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
		.sc-row .sc-dot { margin: 0; }
		.sc-r1 { grid-row: 4; } .sc-c1 { grid-row: 5; }
		.sc-r2 { grid-row: 6; } .sc-c2 { grid-row: 7; }
		.sc-r3 { grid-row: 8; } .sc-c3 { grid-row: 9; }
		.sc-r4 { grid-row: 10; }
		.sc-cdf { grid-column: 1; } .sc-pl { grid-column: 2; }
		.sc-estate { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 11; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 34rem) {
		.sc-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
		.sc-cdf-h, .sc-pl-h { display: none; }
		.sc-stock-h { order: 0; } .sc-stock { order: 1; } .sc-r1 { order: 2; } .sc-cdf.sc-c1 { order: 3; } .sc-pl.sc-c1 { order: 4; }
		.sc-r2 { order: 5; } .sc-cdf.sc-c2 { order: 6; } .sc-pl.sc-c2 { order: 7; }
		.sc-r3 { order: 8; } .sc-cdf.sc-c3 { order: 9; } .sc-pl.sc-c3 { order: 10; }
		.sc-r4 { order: 11; } .sc-estate { order: 12; }
		.sc-cdf::before { content: 'choudoufu'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--cdf); }
		.sc-pl::before { content: 'plunge'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pl); }
	}
</style>
